{
  "notes": [
    "Synthetic values only. Send x-waldo-app-contract: health=5 (or later) with these readings; a backend that does not know a signal yet rejects that reading alone on the receipt (per-sample, revision 3).",
    "A workout keeps activity (its type), value (its minutes), start_at/end_at and energy_kcal as before. Every other workout key is optional: send what HealthKit has for that session and leave the rest out, never a zero.",
    "hr_zones.seconds are the time in zones 1-5, bucketed on the phone from the session's heart-rate samples on the bounds it names; lower_bounds_bpm are where zones 2-5 start. Their sum fits inside the session (one minute of slack).",
    "effort.method is 'rated' for HKQuantityTypeIdentifierWorkoutEffortScore and 'estimated' for estimatedWorkoutEffortScore.",
    "To enrich a workout already uploaded, send it again at a higher revision; the same revision with other content is revision_conflict.",
    "Phone-computed beat-to-beat RMSSD goes out as hrv_window (method rmssd, n_beats) or overnight_hrv (method rmssd): never on an SDNN reading.",
    "A fully described workout is under 1 KiB; split uploads by bytes (98,304) as well as by count (128)."
